			"notes": "- `ConfigSerializer` and `ConfigDeserializer` have been deprecated in favor of `ConfigCodec` (not the DFU kind), which has complete control over serialization.\n    - Since they now need to be registered, the `pconfigFormat` entrypoint and the `ConfigFormatInitializer` has been added to register custom `ConfigCodec`s before configs are loaded.\n- `RootConfigCategory` has been deprecated; to specify the file format, the \"key\" of your root category should be the full file name with the file extension.\n- Test code is no longer bundled with the mod.\n- Config reloading is now handled by `ConfigManager`\n- Support for Recipe Conditions\n- General cleanup."
		},
